<definition version="0.200" type="element" link_type="simple" width="610" height="530" hotspot_x="20" hotspot_y="20">
    <uuid uuid="{bef3ad2d-3f46-5f4b-aa91-2203308c9e87}" />
    <names>
        <name lang="en">SolarEdge SE100K Synergy Manager 100 kW 3F</name>
        <name lang="sl">SolarEdge SE100K Synergy Manager 100 kW 3F</name>
    </names>
    <elementInformations>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">SolarEdge</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">SLESE100K-RW00IBNM4</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">SolarEdge SE100K Synergy Manager 100 kW 3F</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">omrežni razsmernik; 3 MPPT, nizov na MPPT [4, 4, 4], U_dc max 1000 V, MPPT [680, 1000] V, I max - A; komunikacija: 2x RS485 (RS485-1 in RS485-2, vsak B, A, G; vgrajena prenapetostna zaščita tip II na obeh vratih), Ethernet LAN (RJ45, CAT6, do 100 m), Wi-Fi (vgrajen; za portal potrebna zunanja antena, opcija), mobilna povezava: Cellular Plug-in (opcija) s priključkom za anteno, PRI - Power Reduction Interface (sponka na kom. plošči), Power bank vhod (predzagon brez omrežja), števec energije: prek RS485 na vodilnem (leader) razsmerniku, notranja komunikacija do vsake Synergy enote (kabel Comm), terminacija RS485: DIP stikalo SW1</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: SolarEdge Installation Guide Three Phase Inverters with Synergy Technology PN: SExxK-xxxxIxxxx, For Europe and APAC, Version 1.4 (Jan. 2023) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: portal.segen.co.uk) str. PDF str. 11 (sestava), 18 (700 m), 25-31 (vmesniki Managerja in enot, mase), 37-49 (DC, PE, AC), 50-61 (komunikacija, RS485), 71 (PRI), 77-79 (SPD, mere); SolarEdge Three Phase Inverter with Synergy Technology For Europe SE50K/SE66.6K/SE90K/SE100K/SE120K, datasheet DS-000008-EU (20. 6. 2023) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: vpsolar.com) str. 2-3; SolarEdge Three Phase Inverter with Synergy Technology For Europe SE50K-SE120K, datasheet DS-00008-1.1-EU (06/2021) - starejša različica, vir teh_iz_ponudb - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: irishellas.com) str. 2-3; Distributerji (naslovi strani v iskalniku, strani niso bile odprte): ESTG 'solaredge 3ph inverter synergy manager 90kw mc4 dc spd' (SE90K-RW00IBNM4); solartraders 'SE100K-RW00IBNM4 without DC switch' in komplet 'SE100K-RW00IBNM4 + 3 SESUK-RW00INNN4 Synergy Units' str. -; teh_iz_ponudb (skupine/A5_solaredge.json) - prejšnji zapis iz ponudb; preverjeno (glej negotovo) str. -</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">18</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">560</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">360</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">295</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
    <informations>Viri: SolarEdge Installation Guide Three Phase Inverters with Synergy Technology PN: SExxK-xxxxIxxxx, For Europe and APAC, Version 1.4 (Jan. 2023) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: portal.segen.co.uk) str. PDF str. 11 (sestava), 18 (700 m), 25-31 (vmesniki Managerja in enot, mase), 37-49 (DC, PE, AC), 50-61 (komunikacija, RS485), 71 (PRI), 77-79 (SPD, mere); SolarEdge Three Phase Inverter with Synergy Technology For Europe SE50K/SE66.6K/SE90K/SE100K/SE120K, datasheet DS-000008-EU (20. 6. 2023) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: vpsolar.com) str. 2-3; SolarEdge Three Phase Inverter with Synergy Technology For Europe SE50K-SE120K, datasheet DS-00008-1.1-EU (06/2021) - starejša različica, vir teh_iz_ponudb - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: irishellas.com) str. 2-3; Distributerji (naslovi strani v iskalniku, strani niso bile odprte): ESTG 'solaredge 3ph inverter synergy manager 90kw mc4 dc spd' (SE90K-RW00IBNM4); solartraders 'SE100K-RW00IBNM4 without DC switch' in komplet 'SE100K-RW00IBNM4 + 3 SESUK-RW00INNN4 Synergy Units' str. -; teh_iz_ponudb (skupine/A5_solaredge.json) - prejšnji zapis iz ponudb; preverjeno (glej negotovo) str. -
Drawn with terminals2qet 0.2.0 from the terminal table</informations>
